\pard\ltrpar\ql\f0\sa180\b\fs28 NEXVARY-MR Government Edition\b0\par
\pard\ltrpar\ql\f0\sa180\b\fs28 Your investigation and device-service workspace\b0\par
\pard\ltrpar\ql\f0\sa180\b0\fs22 Bring device diagnostics, case management, evidence records and intelligence search into one Windows application. Move between tasks through clear service cards, with Arabic and English interfaces.\b0\par
\pard\ltrpar\ql\f0\sa180\b\fs28 Explore your workspace\b0\par
\pard\ltrpar\ql\f0\sa180\b0\fs22 Device services: inspect connected devices and use supported repair and diagnostic tools. Some operations require separately installed tools, compatible hardware and explicit consent.\b0\par
\pard\ltrpar\ql\f0\sa180\b0\fs22 Cases and evidence: create and reopen cases, record authority and scope, attach results and retain an audit trail.\b0\par
\pard\ltrpar\ql\f0\sa180\b0\fs22 NEXVARY Intelligence: choose a search card such as email or phone, enter the target and select a service from the connected provider catalog. Results come from the service response, not generated demo findings.\b0\par
\pard\ltrpar\ql\f0\sa180\b\fs28 Connect on your terms\b0\par
\pard\ltrpar\ql\f0\sa180\b0\fs22 Normal work uses your Windows profile without a separate application account. Store your API credential protected for that Windows user, then explicitly test the connection and load available services. Internet access, a valid credential and provider entitlement are required for live searches.\b0\par
\pard\ltrpar\ql\f0\sa180\b0\fs22 Review the displayed EUR 14.00 customer search price before execution. Supplier credit requirements vary by service; opening cards and installing the application do not execute paid searches. An invoice marked due is not a collected payment.\b0\par
